{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggeLrar3MD13p2v6Q3K3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For tetrahedral d⁸ Ni(II), **Dq ≈ 427 cm⁻¹, 10Dq ≈ 4 270 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 899 cm⁻¹**. I worked this out by hand from the standard ligand-field expressions and did not use the fitting tools.\n\n**Approach**\n\nA tetrahedral d⁸ ion has the same term pattern as an octahedral d² ion. The ground term is ³T₁(F), and there are three spin-allowed bands:\n\n- ν₁: ³T₁(F) → ³T₂\n- ν₂: ³T₁(F) → ³A₂\n- ν₃: ³T₁(F) → ³T₁(P)\n\nThe two ³T₁ states mix through the 2×2 matrix [[−6Dq, 4Dq], [4Dq, 15B]]. Writing R = √(225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq²), the band energies are:\n\n- ν₁ = 5Dq − 7.5B + ½R\n- ν₂ = 15Dq − 7.5B + ½R\n- ν₃ = R\n\n**Solving**\n\n1. Subtracting the first two equations gives ν₂ − ν₁ = 10Dq = 7 870 − 3 600 = 4 270 cm⁻¹. So **Dq ≈ 427 cm⁻¹**.\n2. ν₃ = R = 16 410 cm⁻¹.\n3. Putting these into the ν₁ equation: 3 600 = 2 135 − 7.5B + 8 205, so 7.5B = 6 740 and **B ≈ 899 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**Checks**\n\n- With Dq = 427 and B = 899, R works out to about 16 400 cm⁻¹. This matches the observed ν₃ of 16 410 cm⁻¹ to within about 10 cm⁻¹.\n- Solving the ν₃ equation directly for B, with Dq fixed at 427, gives B ≈ 899 cm⁻¹ again.\n- So the three bands agree with each other.\n\n**What the numbers mean**\n\n- The free-ion value of B for Ni²⁺ is about 1 041 cm⁻¹. That gives β ≈ 0.86, a moderate nephelauxetic reduction, which points to some covalency in the metal–ligand bonds.\n- The small 10Dq is typical of a tetrahedral field, which is about 4/9 of a comparable octahedral one.\n- The Racah parameter C cannot be found from these data, because none of the spin-allowed d⁸ (or d²) transitions depend on it.\n\n{\"Dq\": 427, \"B\": 899, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Three spin-allowed tetrahedral d8 bands fixed Dq (from ν2−ν1) and B consistently; C does not enter.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7975,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7975,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1884da19-5993-4f25-bd79-d46165b34772","uuid":"55c7cd50-1a6f-45d5-8d87-df6254303af2","timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:43:05.550Z","request_id":"req_011CggeLrEkhbaTZ389qekeA"}
